    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious 3-bed apartment with own entrance.  Close to amenities and coastline.\r\nGREAT FIRST HOME, HOLIDAY OR INVESTMENT PROPERTY!\r\n\r\nThis 3-bedroom apartment of approx. 80 m² comes to market in good condition with attractive features throughout. Once a working mill, the building was tastefully converted into five unique apartments. Apartment 2 is located centrally within the development and benefits from its own private entrance and parking. The interior is nicely laid out with a large, open plan living/kitchen/dining area which is bright and comfortable with the inner hallway leading to 3 well-proportioned bedrooms and bathroom. The location is superb, just minutes from the villages of Duncormick, Carrig-on-Bannow, and the commercial hub of Wellingtonbridge. Wexford Town is only 20 minutes away, with Rosslare Europort reachable in approximately 30 minutes. With numerous sandy beaches lining the scenic South Wexford coastline and historic sites nearby, this is an ideal chance to acquire a well-maintained property in a desirable area, perfect as a permanent residence, holiday getaway, or investment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Greeting Hall                   2.30m x 2.27m solid wood door, tile flooring, coved ceiling, built in storage, leading to inner hallway.\r\nInner Hallways                3.37m x 1.12m solid hardwood entrance door with glass, wood flooring, hallway to bedrooms  7.58m x 1.02m with hot press and access to attic.\r\nKitchen/Living Area        7.13m x 3.52m spacious and bright open floorplan with wood flooring in living area, high vaulted ceiling with exposed wooden beams, feature painted wood panel wall, tile kitchen flooring, fitted kitchen cabinets, laminate counter tops, stainless steel sink, integrated electric oven & hob with extractor fan.\r\nBedroom 1                      4.53m x 3.62m wood flooring, coved ceiling with ceiling rose.\r\nBedroom 2                      2.85m x 2.37m wood flooring, coved ceiling with ceiling rose.\r\nBedroom 3                      4.17m x 2.35m wood flooring, coved ceiling, dual aspect windows.\r\nBathroom                        2.24m x 2.50m  half tiled walls, bathtub, overhead shower, WC, WHB."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious and bright 3-bed apartment with own entrance and ample parking.\r\nLarge roof space for storage or possible conversion.\r\nWood flooring and coving throughout with attractive open plan living/kitchen area.\r\nGated and gravel driveway with ample parking.\r\nDouble glazed PVC windows and newly painted exterior.\r\nClose to all amenities and numerous beaches.\r\nAnnual maintenance fee of €980.\r\nServiced by electric storage heating, mains water and group sewage, broadband available."
      },
